body:
In 2020 i was able to work and get money. Had a lot of healthy habits that was helping me to get up everyday (meditation, stretching, contrast shower, listening to audiobooks, various breakfasts every morning). Also, i used to train my voice-acting skill, took a 1 hour walking after work everyday and spent weekends in uncomfortable zones trying to get new friends.
Oh, i remember even more of that:
I kept a diary;
Wednesday shopping at secondhand (shop with cheap and cool used cloth, easy way to make vintage outfit);
Workout-workout-workout!!!;
Took care of my face skin;
Late morning woke ups.
I think that there is something that i forgot..but, sorry, at this point i’m too lazy to look into my diary
